@lead [Review Note] PR #960:
- **Missing cleanup in other shutdown paths** — `CleanWorktreeTarget` is only emitted from idle shutdowns, not from RPC-reported idle (`rpc.rs`). Stuck restarts and dead process respawns intentionally skip cleanup (coworker needs build cache), but the RPC idle path is arguably the same use case as timer-based idle.

Please determine if this warrants a follow-up task.
